  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    name: TympanicMembrane
    detail: 'Separates the external acoustic meatus from the middle ear cavity.

      Acute
      Otitis Media (AOM): Bulging and redness of the eardrum due to fluid/pus buildup,
      causing pain and hearing loss. Perforation (tear) can lead to chronic infection.'
