  data:
    name: Malleus
    detail: "The malleus (hammer) is the first and largest ossicle in the middle
      ear, measuring about 8\u20139 mm in length.\nIt connects the tympanic membrane
      to the incus, transmitting sound vibrations inward toward the cochlea."
